{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_001har_title", "source_sha256": "d5c8d130c4291273b4911e452cf25e6853dc231a8273efc599d082673f4203db", "ja": "春香と舞台裏", "zh": "春香与后台", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_001har_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f9c439772f1d6610887310dce19c7333f87d52e7a643ece15bf939a2f61793b8", "ja": "春香との舞台裏の一幕です。", "zh": "这是与春香在后台的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_001har_1000_402cpr", "source_sha256": "9ca49ba3e1453721a2c34ec67eb3c193cb63bf551f14b8cae0fda77b198581eb", "ja": "お疲れさま、春香。\n……？　どうかしたのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，春香。……？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_001har_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "6260092c1216333f6b9e76c5174c39d8dcdef9775fa819f9e31956b7812212da", "ja": "その……、今日はダンサー組のみんなと\nレッスンだったんですけど……。", "zh": "那个……今天和舞蹈组的大家一起上课来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_001har_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "235d5e21ae5af3fa57b960c0558ad358c49a60e75142260ae5f4959e8c7f98b9", "ja": "みんなの息が、ちょっと合ってないみたいなんです。\nどうしてもレベルに差が出てきちゃうみたいで……。", "zh": "大家好像有点配合不默契。\n水平无论如何好像都会拉开差距……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_001har_1003_402cpr", "source_sha256": "5ce466a9805da8cc5e266f199b9cd7143b3c574a76325eb69ddb2b480e117f7b", "ja": "なるほど……、難しいよな。\n新人だと、お互いを見る余裕もないだろうし。", "zh": "原来如此……确实很难啊。\n毕竟是新人，应该也没有余力顾及彼此吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_001har_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "626ba5eb84387a9ad54465edaa7d40246ef52608e1e987c9105b3444f85ce892", "ja": "ひとりひとりは頑張ってるんですけど、\nレベルを下げないと厳しいっていう意見もあって。", "zh": "虽然每个人都在努力，但也有人觉得，如果不降低难度的话会很困难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_001har_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "97bf483ae28654fcc0f093824b7c2d4c423b878831dcefe35759c6b64a498911", "ja": "でも、下げたくないって子も……。うう、やっぱり\n全員が納得できるようにって、難しいんでしょうか？", "zh": "不过，也有不想降低难度的成员……唔，果然，要让所有人都满意，还是很难吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_001har_1006_402cpr", "source_sha256": "4d502c273471f4ccb5a8f62c23e3c6a59bbc3cd5aba7c9d8414422b112b34a42", "ja": "……簡単じゃないよな。でも、春香はそうやって、\nみんなの気持ちを受け止めてくれてる。", "zh": "……确实不容易啊。但是，春香你像这样，\n好好地接纳了大家的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_001har_1007_402cpr", "source_sha256": "2330366b3ad7fefc5cab762bd376876164cf75753166891010199c0dcfdbce03", "ja": "だから、言っていいと思うんだ。\nみんなの気持ちを受けた、春香の気持ち。", "zh": "所以，我觉得可以说出来。接受了大家心意后的，春香的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_001har_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "e6b737d074175a6eb417e648e0a7f650de20e216a822425019d89da8791adabc", "ja": "私の、気持ち……。\nそう、ですよね……。私には、それしか……！", "zh": "我的心情……。\n是、是啊……。我能做的，只有这个了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_001har_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "52128a1bd0847b2c80e892102a56adcecfd5d0a9c02bf10a8ba2d2a3820b665f", "ja": "ありがとうございます、プロデューサーさん。\n今度、思いきってみんなに伝えてみますね。", "zh": "谢谢您，制作人。\n下次我会鼓起勇气，向大家倾诉心声的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_001har_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "3564618e1ebc42ad03a33bb422f851f30722ae28bd40f7c103dd7a357f2db1d9", "ja": "私が……、どうしたいかって！", "zh": "就是我……想要怎么做这件事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
